{"title":"2013 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Formula_for_Sum_of_Cubes)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Formula for Sum of Cubes)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/c/b1c3ecd7c67b34e51f881bb71498163bb024680a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^{3} + 2^{3} + 3^{3} + 4^{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/7/6c7f742123254af8d206a9a0bab3d5edd9408744.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10^{1} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 10^{3} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 10^{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 10^{5} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 10^{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"434\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/a/a9ae279d321bdf171e5be46594820bc1f81e316b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^{3} + 2^{3} + 3^{3} + 4^{3} = 1 + 8 + 27 + 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"280\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/6/ac6d30760e6185e0c72c6e765fb8c8d11dd362d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=9 + 91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/b/4ebd2d12520b81444e8b130e86e4a71b6a352d6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/6/3766aa656bd600b6e6ce50438cdd56a161ede86d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 10^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"93\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher and Wisehawkcutefriendly\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Formula_for_Sum_of_Cubes.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Formula_for_Sum_of_Cubes)\">Solution 2 (Formula for Sum of Cubes)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Formula for Sum of Cubes)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> cubes is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/4/7a43c2a5771ff36496d7e796ce2967e42932d577.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{n(n + 1)}{2})^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"95\" height=\"40\" />. Since there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/f/3cf8f9e0a94511725e40bbbce150ecad4e400723.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^{3} + 2^{3} + 3^{3} + 4^{3} = (\\frac{4(4 + 1)}{2})^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"248\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55a87407fe682ab52e76509fa83c4a2739323d13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=(\\frac{20}{2})^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"65\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/6/3766aa656bd600b6e6ce50438cdd56a161ede86d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 10^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"93\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/3/403b8ac758a13b02749a131e86c6247fe2641046.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^{3} + 2^{3} + 3^{3} + 4^{3} &lt; 4 \\times 4^{3} = 256$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"258\" height=\"18\" />. The only answer choices that are less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/d/abd678361b0f40ec2723283c0f2bab3df5cadc68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$256$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> are A and C.\n</p><p>However, we can realize that answer choice A is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, which is clearly less than our sum because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/d/5bddc37dcba2e1e491535b290f280c208f7bcc02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{3} = 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" /> and all of the numbers are positive.\n</p><p>Thus, the answer must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/a/baa4156f41125d5c7246a1b1cc87be4bd5c3b56d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 10^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"74\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher and Wisehawkcutefriendly\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2013 CEMC Pascal\">2013 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4\" cla